00:48:06,910 --> 00:48:14,035
In general, with most high-risk pregnancies, testing begins by 32 to 34 weeks’ gestation.

385
00:48:14,035 --> 00:48:22,822
Pregnancies with severe complications, such as fetal-growth restriction, might require testing as early as 26 to 28 weeks.

